  "source_code": "MOD = 998244353\r\nMAX = 2000000\r\n\r\ninv = [0] * (MAX + 1)\r\nh = [0] * (MAX + 1)\r\n\r\n\r\ninv[1] = h[1] = 1\r\n\r\nfor i in range (2, MAX + 1):\r\n    inv[i] = MOD - (MOD//i)*inv[MOD%i]%MOD\r\n    \r\n    h[i] = (h[i - 1] + inv[i]) % MOD\r\nt = int(input())\r\nfor _ in range (t):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    a =  list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    ans = 0 \r\n    for i, x in enumerate(a):\r\n        ans += x*(h[i]+h[n-i - 1 ])\r\n    print(ans % MOD)",
